lb: strchr() instead of index().

index() is a legacy BSD function QNX's C library does not provide (the link
fails with an undefined reference); strchr() is the standard equivalent.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

--- a/apps/lb/lb.c
+++ b/apps/lb/lb.c
@@ -406,7 +406,7 @@ static void usage()
 static int
 parse_pipes(const char *spec)
 {
-	const char *end = index(spec, ':');
+	const char *end = strchr(spec, ':');
 	static int max_groups = 0;
 	struct group_des *g;
 
